    "description": {
      "value": "Made from constrictor snakeskin, the strips of this +1 leather armor wrap around you like an anaconda might wrap around its victim. The first time you roll a 1 on any attack roll or check after donning the armor, it fuses with you and constricts. It constricts anytime you roll a 1 on any attack roll or check thereafter. When the armor constricts, you're restrained for 1 round.\n\n- **Activate:** 1 Action\n\nThe armor wraps around you, allowing you to don it by the time the activation finishes."
